    {
      "subId": "7418426",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "741842601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "741842601": {
            "id": "741842601",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "???",
            "text": "Imperator. Imperator...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741842602"
            ]
          },
          "741842602": {
            "id": "741842602",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "A... dream...?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741842603"
            ]
          },
          "741842603": {
            "id": "741842603",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "████",
            "text": "You're finally awake, Imperator. This day is one of great import, the day when we shall sound the great Symphony, Phobos. There is yet time before the ritual, Imperator, but we should set out.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741842604"
            ]
          },
          "741842604": {
            "id": "741842604",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I seem to have had a dream.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741842605"
            ]
          },
          "741842605": {
            "id": "741842605",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "████",
            "text": "A dream, Imperator? I did not know that gods could dream... In that case, what did you dream of? The great plains beyond the north wind? The silver tree beneath the frozen soil...?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741842606"
            ]
          },
          "741842606": {
            "id": "741842606",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "████",
            "text": "Or did you see that golden future that you once showed me?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741842607"
            ]
          },
          "741842607": {
            "id": "741842607",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I saw... the sea swallowing the earth...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741842608"
            ]
          },
          "741842608": {
            "id": "741842608",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "The children of white stone and brass sinking...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741842609"
            ]
          },
          "741842609": {
            "id": "741842609",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "The collapse of all that was once radiant.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741842610"
            ]
          },
          "741842610": {
            "id": "741842610",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "████",
            "text": "...That prophecy, then, Imperator? It is precisely to prevent it from happening, to fight against inevitable fate, that we are here today.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741842611"
            ]
          },
          "741842611": {
            "id": "741842611",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "████",
            "text": "Just as you said, we have paid much for it, but once we are free of fa{RUBY#[D]Fortuna's}te's shackles, those sacrifices shall not have been in vain...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741842612"
            ]
          },
          "741842612": {
            "id": "741842612",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "████",
            "text": "In this have I had faith ever since I accepted this body and became a Remurian...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741842613"
            ]
          },
          "741842613": {
            "id": "741842613",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "████",
            "text": "...Apologies, Imperator. Forgive my lack of manners.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741842614"
            ]
          },
          "741842614": {
            "id": "741842614",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "████",
            "text": "In any case, please, come with me."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7418436",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "741843601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "741843601": {
            "id": "741843601",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "███",
            "text": "Remus, Remus...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741843602"
            ]
          },
          "741843602": {
            "id": "741843602",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "███",
            "text": "Remus. You once said that you would create a future free from the shackles of divine destiny.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741843603"
            ]
          },
          "741843603": {
            "id": "741843603",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "███",
            "text": "Yet your realm now lies violently shattered, and the chasm you tried to bridge has grown deeper still. The immortal race you created and the peoples of the waters are slaughtering one another.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741843604"
            ]
          },
          "741843604": {
            "id": "741843604",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "███",
            "text": "And now, this so-called Eternal City too faces imminent collapse...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741843605"
            ]
          },
          "741843605": {
            "id": "741843605",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "███",
            "text": "You cannot control your own creation... The \"Symphony\" has brought neither justice nor happiness, but instead has become the source of all sin.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741843606"
            ]
          },
          "741843606": {
            "id": "741843606",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "███",
            "text": "Though their flesh and blood have been sundered from water and soil, the lost souls guide them upon the path of inevitable death nonetheless. The curse of Fortuna is upon your people, and upon you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741843607"
            ]
          },
          "741843607": {
            "id": "741843607",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Do you still remember our promise...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741843608"
            ]
          },
          "741843608": {
            "id": "741843608",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "That is our last resort... As long as the Symphony is played...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741843609"
            ]
          },
          "741843609": {
            "id": "741843609",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "███",
            "text": "Is this the only way you usurper-lords of humanity know to atone after bringing things to ruination? Still, your resolve, at least, does not shame your kingly crown.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741843610"
            ]
          },
          "741843610": {
            "id": "741843610",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "███",
            "text": "And a promise was made, indeed. Therefore, allow me to bear witness to your end..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7418408",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Paimon",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "741840801"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "741840801": {
            "id": "741840801",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#...{NICKNAME}... Please, wake up...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741840802"
            ]
          },
          "741840802": {
            "id": "741840802",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I... Just now...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741840803"
            ]
          },
          "741840803": {
            "id": "741840803",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#Waaah! You scared me to death! {NICKNAME}, you...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741840804"
            ]
          },
          "741840804": {
            "id": "741840804",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "You suddenly just... Completely stopped moving and started staring at the statue! Like you were a statue yourself! Paimon thought you had been turned to stone by the dark lord's evil curse...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741840805"
            ]
          },
          "741840805": {
            "id": "741840805",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I think I had a strange daydream...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741840806"
            ]
          },
          "741840806": {
            "id": "741840806",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#Th—There isn't really a curse, is there!? {NICKNAME}, are you okay!?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741840808"
            ]
          },
          "741840808": {
            "id": "741840808",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I'm fine. Sorry for making you worry.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741840807"
            ]
          },
          "741840807": {
            "id": "741840807",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "As long as you're not hurt... Yeah, we should definitely go to Petrichor first."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7418420",
      "subQuestName": "Head to Petrichor",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7418409",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "741840901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "741840901": {
            "id": "741840901",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "\"Bellringer\"",
            "text": "Welcome, travelers, O traversers of dreamscapes.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741840902"
            ]
          },
          "741840902": {
            "id": "741840902",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "\"Bellringer\"",
            "text": "I am the bellringer at the intersection clock tower — the guide that welcomes travelers to the Eternal City.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741840904",
              "741840906"
            ]
          },
          "741840904": {
            "id": "741840904",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "(...Could he be part of the same troupe as those thieves from before?)",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741840907"
            ]
          },
          "741840907": {
            "id": "741840907",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Um, leaving that aside for now, all the townspeople we ran into on the way over were acting really weird. Do you know what that's about?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741840908"
            ]
          },
          "741840908": {
            "id": "741840908",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "\"Bellringer\"",
            "text": "Why, everyone has gone to Machimos already. I imagine that they now dwell under the protection of the Sebastos.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741840909"
            ]
          },
          "741840909": {
            "id": "741840909",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Wow, so in addition to the \"Dark Lord Remus,\" now we've got a \"Sebastos\"? This is getting more complicated by the minute!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741840910"
            ]
          },
          "741840910": {
            "id": "741840910",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "\"Bellringer\"",
            "text": "\"Dark Lord Remus\"... It would appear that in your journey, you have crossed paths with those uncouth barbarians. That is indeed a blasphemous title with which they besmirch the Sebastos Remus, our mighty Imperator.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741840911"
            ]
          },
          "741840911": {
            "id": "741840911",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Oh, so they're both the same Remus! They are the same person after all.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741840912"
            ]
          },
          "741840912": {
            "id": "741840912",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "\"Bellringer\"",
            "text": "But it is of no consequence! The Sebastos may not be defined by the narrow notions of the tribal mob. Those despicable insects may speak slander as they wish, but the wise, inspired by his noblest ideals, will yet come forth in their droves.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741840913"
            ]
          },
          "741840913": {
            "id": "741840913",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "\"Bellringer\"",
            "text": "When the bell of eternity tolls, all that has ever come to pass shall be erased, and all will be reborn, regardless of who they are or where they are from! Be grateful, and rejoice! Praise be!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741840914"
            ]
          },
          "741840914": {
            "id": "741840914",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#What should we do, {NICKNAME}? This person sure seems lucid, but the stuff he's spouting is all kinds of whack! Y'think we've got a sleepwalker here? Maybe he's dreaming?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741840915"
            ]
          },
          "741840915": {
            "id": "741840915",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "\"Bellringer\"",
            "text": "Hmm? Do you name me a dreamer?"
          },
          "741840906": {
            "id": "741840906",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Wait, you're in character already!? Are you sure you're okay?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
