    {
      "subId": "7418416",
      "subQuestName": "Go to the underwater Faded Castle",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7418435",
      "subQuestName": "Go to the underwater Faded Castle",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "741843501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "741843501": {
            "id": "741843501",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Huh, Paimon didn't think there'd be such a huge space down below. Guess you do know your stuff, Osse!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741843502"
            ]
          },
          "741843502": {
            "id": "741843502",
            "speakerId": 1009,
            "speakerName": "Osse",
            "text": "This is but the tip of the iceberg! Once, an entire nation and the land upon which it was built sank beneath the waves... and my mission is to prevent that which has sunk from resurfacing.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741843503"
            ]
          },
          "741843503": {
            "id": "741843503",
            "speakerId": 1009,
            "speakerName": "Osse",
            "text": "...Or so I believe.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741843505",
              "741843509"
            ]
          },
          "741843505": {
            "id": "741843505",
            "speakerId": 1009,
            "speakerName": "Osse",
            "text": "Well, what am I but a cat that knows an inkling more than those in town, hmm?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741843506"
            ]
          },
          "741843506": {
            "id": "741843506",
            "speakerId": 1009,
            "speakerName": "Osse",
            "text": "Hehe... Anyway, we are the sole arbiters of whether the souls of the townsfolk can safely return to their bodies or not, so eyes up, now.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741843507"
            ]
          },
          "741843507": {
            "id": "741843507",
            "speakerId": 1009,
            "speakerName": "Osse",
            "text": "The Faded Castle is just through that great gate. Let us continue onward."
          },
          "741843509": {
            "id": "741843509",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "In that case, leave the guiding to Paimon! ...Well, that's what Paimon would like to say, anyway!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7418428",
      "subQuestName": "Head to the Faded Castle",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7418418",
      "subQuestName": "Obtain a fantastical music box",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "741841801"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "741841801": {
            "id": "741841801",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Whoa, Paimon bets a lot of people can live in a huge castle like this!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741841802"
            ]
          },
          "741841802": {
            "id": "741841802",
            "speakerId": 1009,
            "speakerName": "Osse",
            "text": "But of course! And not just people, either...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741841803"
            ]
          },
          "741841803": {
            "id": "741841803",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hey! There you go again, saying creepy stuff with a straight face!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741841804"
            ]
          },
          "741841804": {
            "id": "741841804",
            "speakerId": 1009,
            "speakerName": "Osse",
            "text": "Oh, fret not! Surely heroes such as yourselves would dispatch any hidden ghosts or phantoms without breaking a sweat?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741841805"
            ]
          },
          "741841805": {
            "id": "741841805",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "And what is this? What an exquisite box! Seems like a music box of some kind! Still, it doesn't seem to fit in too well with its surroundings.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741841806"
            ]
          },
          "741841806": {
            "id": "741841806",
            "speakerId": 1009,
            "speakerName": "Osse",
            "text": "Good eye. That is indeed a music box, but just as I have knowledge beyond ordinary cats, this music box has functions beyond most others.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741841808",
              "741841810"
            ]
          },
          "741841808": {
            "id": "741841808",
            "speakerId": 1009,
            "speakerName": "Osse",
            "text": "Hmm? That... did not cross my mind. Regrettably, it does not have such a function — for now, at least.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741841813"
            ]
          },
          "741841813": {
            "id": "741841813",
            "speakerId": 1009,
            "speakerName": "Osse",
            "text": "Anyway, even those who lack any musical knowledge can freely operate the power of the \"Symphony\" using this box. We will have use of it later, I am sure.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741841814"
            ]
          },
          "741841814": {
            "id": "741841814",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#Huh? But isn't it because this \"Symphony\" has gone all whacky that all the townsfolk turned into... whatever they are now? So what if {NICKNAME} presses the wrong button or something?"
          },
          "741841810": {
            "id": "741841810",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hey, Paimon was just joking before! She didn't think you'd take it seriously... Um, it's Paimon's fault, okay? Don't be mad...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741841811"
            ]
          },
          "741841811": {
            "id": "741841811",
            "speakerId": 1009,
            "speakerName": "Osse",
            "text": "Meow, meow?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741841812"
            ]
          },
          "741841812": {
            "id": "741841812",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Seriously!? Now you pretend to be a cat?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7418432",
      "subQuestName": "Obtain a fantastical music box",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "741843201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "741843201": {
            "id": "741843201",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Ooh, that's a pretty happy tune, Paimon's feeling all warm and fuzzy inside...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741843202"
            ]
          },
          "741843202": {
            "id": "741843202",
            "speakerId": 1009,
            "speakerName": "Osse",
            "text": "Hehe, it seems this box still functions. Well now, are we not safe?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741843203"
            ]
          },
          "741843203": {
            "id": "741843203",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Wait, so you weren't even sure if it would work or not!?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741843204"
            ]
          },
          "741843204": {
            "id": "741843204",
            "speakerId": 1009,
            "speakerName": "Osse",
            "text": "Not completely. One cannot judge a box by its cover, do you not concur?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741843205"
            ]
          },
          "741843205": {
            "id": "741843205",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Paimon gets the feeling that you're not talking about the box at all... But never mind that. What should we do now?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741843206"
            ]
          },
          "741843206": {
            "id": "741843206",
            "speakerId": 1009,
            "speakerName": "Osse",
            "text": "The chaotic \"Symphony\" must be here. If we can locate it, we can retrieve the souls that have been taken from the townsfolk.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741843207"
            ]
          },
          "741843207": {
            "id": "741843207",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Then let's have a look around for starters.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741843208"
            ]
          },
          "741843208": {
            "id": "741843208",
            "speakerId": 1009,
            "speakerName": "Osse",
            "text": "A reasonable judgment. If memory serves, this castle has a great many strange rooms. Perhaps they are worth investigating first.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741843209"
            ]
          },
          "741843209": {
            "id": "741843209",
            "speakerId": 1009,
            "speakerName": "Osse",
            "text": "Also, the castle's central hall plays host to a mysterious stage. Though no more plays shall ever be performed there...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741843210"
            ]
          },
          "741843210": {
            "id": "741843210",
            "speakerId": 1009,
            "speakerName": "Osse",
            "text": "It was once an entrance to a place deeper underwater still, where the power of the \"Symphony\" yet lingers. We must go and check for any further anomalies there.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741843211"
            ]
          },
          "741843211": {
            "id": "741843211",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Deeper still...?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741843212"
            ]
          },
          "741843212": {
            "id": "741843212",
            "speakerId": 1009,
            "speakerName": "Osse",
            "text": "Indeed. I wonder what awaits us there?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741843213"
            ]
          },
          "741843213": {
            "id": "741843213",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hey, now's not the time to leave us hanging, Osse! You're a surprisingly petty one, huh?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741843214"
            ]
          },
          "741843214": {
            "id": "741843214",
            "speakerId": 1009,
            "speakerName": "Osse",
            "text": "Still, before the riddle may be solved, we must first find the clues that await us in the castle. Come, let us away."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7418438",
      "subQuestName": "Head to Petrichor",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
